<title>RUSSIA: PRESS DIGEST - RUSSIA - JUNE 13.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - RUSSIA - JUNE 13.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are some of the leading stories in the June 14 edition of Russia's Izvestia newspaper. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Russia's steel tube producers are seeking government support in their confrontation with European Union over anti-dumping taxes.</p>
<p>- The biggest truck producer KamAZ is getting a loan of about $150 million from Japan.</p>
<p>--Tatayna Ustinova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520.</p>
